{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10016_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:15cee154d13f6f0ac40dbbc22b1ba964fa2875b31addc7ee875699e845790e65",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c7542b4a6fc849787cf7c7275fb475cff20dbedc88e77c480cf75b05e14bbac",
      "text": "青春正当时！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d61bd4265c76467843774f4974c3ce397a8035e3df5da5d5acff5e5305497063",
      "text": "High×Joker决定在新年举办专场Live。\n在训练间隙，大家一起写寒假作业，\n约定去看新年的日出，在这期间，\n春名将现在的自己与过去的自己进行了对比。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c7542b4a6fc849787cf7c7275fb475cff20dbedc88e77c480cf75b05e14bbac",
      "text": "青春正当时！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b62f64f80a5c3619974b6587b7b923a36f604ea583e04211e5d9a7f6e6d0284b",
      "text": "（今天训练时要吃的甜甜圈，\n顺利买到手啦！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b6a6d8dc33df20a45cd646233ca50e0022697bacd03f8ea72c66fcd9bbf0841",
      "text": "（限定期间的甜甜圈也在最后关头\n买到了大家的份，运气真好啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d7bf884066cfe9f8831fcd5efe14d8a8f996e034d9307df2ad478e50fe18798",
      "text": "（这条路在施工啊。……不久之前\n我也在那边打过工来着……啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8510130d691aabe9f31c87f00cfc0997906c3e63b8db832fbfe973777b390351",
      "text": "喂——大叔！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498d119853c621ef7ff8e33d96b88c84a9eedb16c081f5d87a54f1774a691b65",
      "text": "哦，这不是若里嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd7c5b098abd2bd745199ae3b15db5a61f6f618ad67a25bd489e3c2c352a5e6",
      "text": "好久不见啦！\n最近都没见你来应聘兼职，过得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5fb49232985b007526771b4d70962f6d38690b3b2189693b1954edbcd3e2363",
      "text": "精神得很呢！为了高中毕业我去参加了社团活动。\n那边忙得很，所以兼职就减少了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2925e85abe1b48c6867dadb7c8db2ec95406cab0833efae7ea74b6d801b26d2",
      "text": "是一个叫High×Joker的5人乐队。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7d9c74caa5b3a7d39f918a5e6fd760deae7339ff5d592983bd5b416c6c2f70a",
      "text": "我们也在做偶像活动，不仅上过杂志，\n还参加过大型的Live呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:937fc0a88ce77d487b8dc82e284fbd094dbc6259f39279395f160d26cad0084b",
      "text": "嚯，偶像啊！\n那确实顾不上打工了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:570effd90133f77d2be5ce400c0d7eb213c412d9e740175eee4648a5d991d527",
      "text": "差不多吧。不过要是实在缺人手，\n记得叫我哦。只要没有偶像工作我就会去的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a1d6fbc396091ca856d92a77170934f0498a34d7f123267d3e44e96a417621",
      "text": "今天能久违地见到你们真开心——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_a:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17f93d5fcb75872ab13376a15fe7a80cff056d515f5a268c1498c8f463fb9ebb",
      "text": "啊，对了！这个，不介意的话大家分着吃吧。\n超级好吃的甜甜圈哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:218e5ad6f38b3fe74daf665d467b9714c51352acd2cb503f8c23c472f02405b1",
      "text": "唔～……完～全搞不懂啊！\n这里的计算到底该怎么弄啊……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa68a88b8e8b5f6bbd6588611d7d4cfd1668ba26b16867afdefa91207bf93e0",
      "text": "旬，拜托啦！教教我这道题怎么解吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:602bbbff34d63a0a60463cb45aabaf22df6edfc8109960f34fe32e8e1c6bac47",
      "text": "我也可以问吗？是英语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea3d4606a35a5bdec985c3de0798a66c0dded681ea242a29c50840e9b93852d",
      "text": "等我做完这部分再帮你们。不会的地方\n先空着，把能做的先做完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:442122653f314302504c19f0aa8b7682c487ce36f4c6fdec04ec57c66581820f",
      "text": "（不会的地方先空着，吗……\n几乎全都不会啊，不过现在还是闭嘴吧。怪吓人的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aba708204ef6fe920175f3bdf4bc62b92c024235e29d13dfbaeebf6c33e11ae",
      "text": "（旬什么时候才做完啊？……好闲啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f2e9bc508e9bdc2405707a8f3f7e8399986a8cdc1ca1c3fe321409b3bf2817f",
      "text": "（说起来四季真安静啊？\n平时早就跟我一起哭着求旬了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88fd7f5f49801acd17ade2244ee80dea626ec3c6af27723361dea30adb5c0217",
      "text": "（看起来也不像是在认真写作业啊。\n感觉一直在盯着手机看……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff5a69524db28a99aa0d2f8a0adc6f454621a2111496616e9cbe59a8077b8494",
      "text": "四季，从刚才起就……坐立不安的。怎么了吗？\n要是有不懂的地方，……我可以教你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:121fc25872d171e0ee81707c0b3d1a47edb71cc09a1753114be63e9b0681b85c",
      "text": "马上就要来通知了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57540681005b506fb6fead8703c3a80b85dc272d5e011e0f670006153cfe7fd7",
      "text": "什么通知？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ec71cfb67fe2738722fefbe45b7eb775aca99fb0e293d2aee389f55a27fe732",
      "text": "四季君，请专心写作业。\n到头来吃苦头的可是你自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130dbcbb381ef63dd9a0f8790b34e905b6610b2d8a03776cefc3aec775b8bd87",
      "text": "拜托了，旬亲。\n就差一点点了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6434a7d217f92d26a7bcac8320e95eff7879452e52610fe735e1285b43f5adf5",
      "text": "来了！\n…………结果是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_b:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:615001be95f2a87cae86e67d92e7977be99603e60f0a8ec52adbdd5f7ca3ebc1",
      "text": "中、中签啦——！\n太棒啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:897511aea82416d5a94d8f5d3169d37f71c4f22553729559af822179f764dcc9",
      "text": "恭喜你，四季！\n话说，抽中什么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf9901ffe80bc011c47b6cbc2e91ea0bd39e8579a0d7da15369346fd9a90d467",
      "text": "登登——！是在展望台看新年日出的\n抽签抽中啦☆名额可是有限的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73ae6c43eecbe01e8a0e04ac95202fee25828c9b573c478ec27b1e6e43a6afe3",
      "text": "大家一起去看新年日出，\n然后再去吃早饭，怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3311f6d0f6cdcbf4e6cb78ba890591c326d0adc70a608ba3456a511112b76e28",
      "text": "哇，好棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0790aad206c631d78d01b05e91fc5ef69330eda79c1e5828ec1b053e0697ffa",
      "text": "我也赞成～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a1da56d13c690c19df64f6939b2322b1f57fc016d5dce05c3a82c1514be74d6",
      "text": "兴奋归兴奋，但元旦的日出可是在\n7点之前哦。大家起得来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30a838e425e0a2eba14648cd74249350d662f2bb2b0e4fcc2aa0d300da5da3fe",
      "text": "早点睡早点起就没问题啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab240da4cecb48c83d4dbc83af625939c4bca54f17b3413225fbcabd458365e6",
      "text": "那个……旬，打算怎么做……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a30929364d6ea2370b17a1255832a7b965787b83b29106c2dfb0755ef1bf4552",
      "text": "那当然要去啦。\n绝对超级好玩的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f67376efd9bc7331867f13cae3fec08053ed12755b193fc202623752d98c3a",
      "text": "就是说啊！还是说你已经有别的安排了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c11093369449d8d59f4b05650306f3f9f57ed795292375085951e667e5ecf9f",
      "text": "旬亲，你觉得怎么样？\n我想和大家一起去看新年的日出！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b9a7a4d5d7ae5c1697902bad343794281f77aa9e6f5614bcacdf97fea8d76ca",
      "text": "明明有Live要开，怎么可能会安排\n别的行程啊。……我也去就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b90d71a9a81066f644bcdab822fe9750fcdaab2543665316e621d4241abbc652",
      "text": "旬要是，去的话……我也……去……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8149329ff7a5ce5b2f38bc64d404366928d544923a7946f773caba80b62d51e5",
      "text": "太好啦——！那我们马上\n决定碰头的时间吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000178:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106",
      "text": "好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55f9a2535a345fca9ec3c07be720a4e8b0df6c02f2cebee7b1bf73eaa96470b4",
      "text": "等一下，先把作业做……\n……根本没在听呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e36e0ad4202be03c13c5a3fecfdfcf79c0e21e0adbce2f9b57b559618c65b739",
      "text": "旬……既然都这样了……\n也拿他们没办法了，吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_c:cmd-000204:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:920f1a7c7210bc0d3d6fe274c5003b9d33b29f4eb4a675576a55a9462568d3d0",
      "text": "唉……得重新规划大家的时间表了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:353d8b41e1831851d17fd514c23b6741fbd61732e6dad6d5d9b2f05ba6f94f42",
      "text": "碰头地点定在哪里呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:507bd34c819de2949765d4366ddc5f5fe41f3b8e75f83145bc641704fb8fd74d",
      "text": "大家方便集合的地方比较好吧。\n车站怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3522f1a7e6a48fccffe6f9c001f6a31ca77ae74c3ecdd4aab93c4df64d8a3a0",
      "text": "（我现在做的事，可真像个正经学生啊～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80ea44852395c47863cc60840976037a7e512b018a9d91ef8969bded20d310b1",
      "text": "（在遇到大家之前，我可从来没和学校的同伴\n这么频繁地呆在一起过呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e31b04faf36e6c85b5f0a01856c2413df055ccdc9384ddb4e04e693098d5259",
      "text": "（每天都忙着打工打工，就算被同班同学\n约着出去玩，基本也都是拒绝掉的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:316c3934ae9ef2f47184a3d447f953930789494f464ae780e424a045432512be",
      "text": "（至于社团活动，也只是看着别人认真投入，\n从没想过自己也会去搞）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0147f958112ff2e9b2729ded0b6df343090be2bf7eb93ae00388758c1a65d652",
      "text": "（现在的我不仅是为了避免留级，\n社团和偶像也全都超级认真地对待着）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab8affe25b9e1aa87b34a0094241467e14d003b8c78f62f3c321c9a89265b79d",
      "text": "（和大家相遇之后，\n我过得超级有青春气息啊？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1df51e6b9d228eaae995b56e48383ad4d36349a6902fa6409c587494584be2c",
      "text": "……呐，春名觉得呢？\n这个时间，方便吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc759d9d2cc2d4099b8611cd37089b5a076ec0803359a6ab4141e5209e5d80b7",
      "text": "嗯？啊，我几点都行，\n配合大家的时间就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f75b699b9751b88022c7909d99919f5c974e5cf2df9a257e3f094a1d527c181",
      "text": "那么，就按这个计划来吧。作业务必在\n当天之前全部写完。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e26a9015eda1acfc78fdbbbdd48d437aac4b8f8fe08c60d765d2fbfd206852a9",
      "text": "知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000177:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64f5075ba7271fac58cb5fd036d47952d45f299ca32e59ad1e560afc319a6f8",
      "text": "除夕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000184:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d82da7dab6e93e3c404f7ebd09f1f74790631482343b068624df9530cd69d27",
      "text": "制作人，\n辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000186:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6b77a5774242ceec4935cf2e1a784e110eeda2dc059194c5ea2bfcad6f91cea",
      "text": "为了明早能起得来，\n我准备睡了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000188:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f201ee34a587d57345c59874cdbceaa2da30e994e56dfb6d81b85c962f4ba3a3",
      "text": "在那之前，\n我是来向您致以年末问候的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000190:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaa0f5ef0e4fb13cb9bed2bc6fc9aa131f4c6be905c028198e0f6437d623b579",
      "text": "制作人，\n今年承蒙您的关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000192:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3c56f32c8dd434055f36def61686a6a253fbf6975bd5364f48c752149c14f9d",
      "text": "真的Mega感谢制作人酱<emoji>image_talk_emoji_36</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000194:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9c55aa6b44f7fccb7d1f5bb245299c7215e83c5cc3fbe9648e62bded04dba4b",
      "text": "能做各种各样的工作\n超级开心的。\n多谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000196:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:295c1335adb5e687ad24e0df1695673068337ac3693317b7d61d545084eb18e5",
      "text": "为了能更活跃，\n我们也会努力的，看着我们吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000198:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d662fd9f0669fcb7abf8cf64f74cd74666d6e580031ffb81ea9ee89d6de4c7",
      "text": "来年也请对High×Joker\n多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000200:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68414bd403e6c610553baf2117b86d65e81982b0fc5e3e9fc1a80473f3cd5d7a",
      "text": "请多关照",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000200:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df2ffab694fb7c4ab1168527e0d67328a8a73c9e48c77b1a78c73a4ffda40b85",
      "text": "我这边才是，\n请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000201:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:795f1b41df27186eecf952a1a95a9103d7b26cf982c27686ee44df3a16db4d11",
      "text": "一起努力吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000201:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed9c0f263c083d141333e13a0cd247cd4b0f8194dbd2bedc335d981c13edb1a7",
      "text": "明年也让我们大家一起\n努力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_d:cmd-000205:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16c21b324461f1d57916f2b1485a44d08b2defbcea02bdb226295779b9cb60cd",
      "text": "嗯！明年的开工日开始\n就拜托啦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_05</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000031:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c7e4bd66d4d7a745cab13d6b95601ea2193442758d87d1f2261296419c1061",
      "text": "元旦·清晨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0eb9a1cf6f185ac5571f148014d0995a0c19eab56661c4a7078b2bc41e1f1f22",
      "text": "耶～☆到达展望台啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e56d8834ee8eb4743f796f88c6b95849dc0cb26a658f3c88b4410d94e69d6fb",
      "text": "哇，人挺少的嘛。不过，能在好位置看日出了呢。\n……啊！大家，快看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4388b33c24a6b15493b5054f76ddd80f028ee6f7d39060cec0b382fdd230d99",
      "text": "啊……远处，变成橙色了呢……\n太阳好像，要升起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e9222f695c7aa8a236937f9e83f559c98413ad60b05a46bafefc01bd9a4aa4f",
      "text": "像这样大家一起看着天空慢慢变亮，\n还是头一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b02451f3cc5565e215dff654c98a7095a6147fec33d6ee423e6ddd03b9d2e26c",
      "text": "感觉我整个人都超级亢奋起来了。\n多亏你抽中了，谢啦，四季！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cd26f4468f09492ad987d78cfb4dd3b4b271352e18899decdabe36475454b82",
      "text": "嘿嘿，不客气啦。对了！\n趁现在大家一起拍张照留念怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f44ddecc554c35348583015557a620299b0125932b18da405ce2b6970bc8a3fa",
      "text": "发给因为准备Live没能来的\n●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d70b07b1879366cc9a13e2137a7138e5bccac1158ffdd6f9cbbc0281d0a7a1c1",
      "text": "那主意不错！\n以朝霞为背景拍一张吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa0759f0947cba9b64e47de142d3ee4d7153cacdb3e6082485c8a3199e539bf1",
      "text": "大家，兴奋归兴奋，\n不过马上就要到日出时间了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_e:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45bbbd4127fae0c2bbc43506696c5911e41a83804f79dc3d8daa82ab678b7b7f",
      "text": "啊——！真的！\n太阳升起的一瞬间绝对不能错过啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000033:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d233ff3d7c2f09661fe2a87454a2e9fd2f4d9d610027448bc2efba361accc17d",
      "text": "哇啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc7483d34386e6600f09395219e04c2a7540bef3dfda917303616168e3788a37",
      "text": "新年的初日，原来这么美啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cc00b19e7664468d54b7d48d7fcba1d1e9d63ff6365a7242fabe8c4305ba12d",
      "text": "嗯……看得很清楚呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed583663bf9095bc5559d2cc9971ed99b874b4228639810688e9f662ca5732a1",
      "text": "怎么说呢，有种无法用言语形容的感动啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38801fefca2be2cd5e98f739025602530eccfb2450ecd7b1c8c48aa416e50ccb",
      "text": "嗯……呵呵，能和大家一起看……\n好开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea0d59a037184c27d578d4abbc52296279baa493c727e413b8babe524329f59",
      "text": "呜～……按捺不住了！\n周围人也不多，没关系的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d85c29426c3e34596d1d692f11125ab4165a351311360c4ee1149f09bdd9ee8b",
      "text": "四季……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26da46c4c3dae689658a20eec3d6ea844aeb7545165f06539ec0d40dc777671e",
      "text": "一定要让High×Joker今年的第一场Live\n圆满成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f044b68f5c81ad54c8f6ac95728da8ced07a2b9f0008d4efed01b425e9ad685b",
      "text": "所以说！\n大家也对着新年的日出宣告今年的抱负吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35f7cbd613e12b35d7f734c727422460f12abc26af184c87e971cb5a32076ec0",
      "text": "感觉挺有青春气息的，不错嘛。\n好，下一个我来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000156:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:921bfb64bc0f36a229ef5c3f02dd9383e22f704d89fdfc814c8627ab31f2148c",
      "text": "我要让自己的吉他弹得比去年更棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95d0d6d123ee64dfb10d764768e60577e1572340194f5fa14709a8cfbd6e9b18",
      "text": "那么，下一个轮到我啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:257160f4ccf7c25b45291c5ff385b4ad06de1ce018e8a4da0aecb1a48cec3858",
      "text": "我也要在鼓技上比去年更努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85c54d82e04995d5854cbbb68e574188f507d803580986911e937076108e5708",
      "text": "来来，接下来轮到旬和夏来了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8653cda61bc4eec291b39da002b56b623740c35dc10ab62d6f3ce3d1782d977e",
      "text": "……诶，我们也要来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_f:cmd-000227:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec479135b128ef1fc8dc36778c6150967463cb5fe5f69d5800df420bd7293575",
      "text": "那当然啦！来来，旬亲和夏来亲也\n砰——！地来宣誓吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a070cc29cf90f231fdd471a2190234145c27a044b3ca0d0ef618907e377a6a1",
      "text": "突然让我们宣言，这……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0510750ed53f2cc0b068b5fd128eb75363b79caa3560f9ac304cae89f0071379",
      "text": "我……先说吧……\n趁这段时间，旬……慢慢想……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b82fa9c74f7b323076ad2e03eb6f85f00ad76b65e69c0ff31f969b2dfa2735bd",
      "text": "我……要把还没掌握的贝斯奏法……\n哪怕多一个也好，全记下来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d34e068e4724ee173149e7fef6aaa408985fd163b8b75e1ca7ed64b89eb5a81a",
      "text": "哦，夏来也是音乐相关的啊。\n旬想好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8647da4ece80bd88f2c5ef4d0e06b3476fa02f0f9e46e64c9934b6eaa26877f",
      "text": "既然限定在音乐领域的话，我……\n今年想更多地参与作曲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b7bee44338f99651c40fa83f33b2033a25a2171935f94c762aec9488cc11fd6",
      "text": "虽然我知道自己更擅长演奏，\n但能写曲子的人还是越多越好嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d5feb810e03d75d7efdb76d6a7f2c6a2b7b4df432ef0acf37f5599bdad4e663",
      "text": "旬写的曲子……想听很多……\n我很期待……哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8817cdffde1ac7643518c8c9da89680eb3e1cf488683c98edd83a447e64db66",
      "text": "我也是！你会写出什么样的曲子，\n我超级无敌期待的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e12e966d917fd563723a3484cace91b0ecf66818508c862eea6d031a59a56bab",
      "text": "哈哈，大家的抱负都很明确嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:140f29f18cc3e2787de41902b2411eb429b45c1b14f2297aa39b23fef103d789",
      "text": "嗯。为了能用最棒的音乐把旬写的曲子\n演奏出来，今年一年大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1381ff5dbc8b36ab697a2a89ad04e2eb2b3aa5e892276f36e73dd0f8fecda1f0",
      "text": "首先，要把今年的第一场Live办成功！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0612d82974869289bc176c98af6879d44b80bf383c257a8cd4fc5adc588ec056",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000201:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8caadece17f1b7fc025600fc7721c7b2382e2e17893bd2df02360126442b4420",
      "text": "新年快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000203:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58c60fca5b64e4fa3f7fa436910cf56cbe6a33d5695c3077080ae66ef50f7768",
      "text": "日出看得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000206:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05001950f29afd12b0370766efe45f47dc2bc1cdb03b3dc1c3308bf5b5327cc3",
      "text": "超级漂亮的哦！\n大家一起拍了照片，待会儿拿给你看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000210:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dd56fb8df9099526153197a297c0c885d313547b6060a35136674317a4fd2a6",
      "text": "明年我也绝对会抽中的，到时候\n●●●●プロデューサー酱也要一起来哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000212:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9b26ffde31135f233c82401e868b3f69c80f92d29746af1acb56802ea2c2224",
      "text": "我们现在准备前往碰头的神社。预计会准时\n到达，待会儿见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000214:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b13622722972eda4d6e5b1ec8c809a4b98048bc5630b66b56f26f3b753f74e28",
      "text": "在展望台……买了土特产……\n碰面的时候，交给你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_g:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e14c864e42054a96096e657bb0acc5e819c141110d8d91f8a847461d4fd0287",
      "text": "那就先这样，●●●●プロデューサー。\n待会儿见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000038:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb94ca830ca18c0927c8ec7566ae76dc1c99384299f5c995b43effc186ea08b9",
      "text": "“New year 315live”开演前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6ed4ac9b2e33bd5aeb8dc29e675f1195c80b81920d165e109838a5bf1f0660d",
      "text": "在这块白幕后面，有各位粉丝在等着我们呢。\n燃起来啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05fe5ad337da90bf4439dc26d1ae716af59bf0efeb583dc5c083795adeeb724b",
      "text": "吉他的状态……嗯，完美！\n大家，准备好了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3c39d58e10651f5d7fa9b78818bf3cc8103d3459c68af79f85e765859d05cd1",
      "text": "没问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e53de0458978a53305161f6d28c6fda043ee307762a63dc643eb699784a9821",
      "text": "那当然。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1255573222a24666576c6cbb8ace03050d52b35371da77966e00d6cbd51d9c19",
      "text": "那么，要上咯！\nWe are……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97f11553505fee3d9b90f2275cc1d550ee6a4f1a0efcaff82ede987019d5d359",
      "text": "High×Joker！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c358090d8cc6b1d1243d457744d6eb10a39ebdb1b77e77ff9e561370a2d0ceb6",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc79a20c3930822fecc3374418777aae8b22b4fe88a362c63a6efed2a50cf27",
      "text": "小猫咪和男子汉们，\n新年快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbda1c71e18331b8dea6e955dfad6839da79b20e3be59479c039c6883ba0ab5b",
      "text": "这是我们High×Joker送给大家的新年压岁钱。\n请收下这首新歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3080a9b5e157a4f37b2ee97e74f133bc7568bb025009133bbdfef6efe9c47978",
      "text": "《JOYFUL HEART MAKER》！！\n大家一起尽情嗨起来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c358090d8cc6b1d1243d457744d6eb10a39ebdb1b77e77ff9e561370a2d0ceb6",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0695d6aa030e5dbb209263b9b8c2c8e1d55fd763be28c0e51e41e66d6c0d25aa",
      "text": "（好厉害……真不是盖的！\n已经气氛Mega MAX啦！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:008b7e0f7b425c2a96381aa995b066568a83407500530755f615362822c372e0",
      "text": "（观众们的热情好高涨……\n我们也不能认输啊！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7722de74aa714b907481e7d8366ad1a2796fc16adf787228d48c1e2f598c7aa4",
      "text": "春名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dcabcfcfa1bc63021ddf54284ab2825edf0d3874e3ffc10b3421937c0019ac5a",
      "text": "哦！上吧，隼人！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb36eb1bc2bd51a125ca9bce5b03f3e21dc73e2c72d4d33b90c3f2a7f997a4b1",
      "text": "请配合我的动作，把手举起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffd61f9480dd996894eb01e5fa90cacad0f6adef3f8ae1efac7e4249b0fff0d5",
      "text": "大家……开心的、笑脸……\n能让我再多看清楚一些吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263bc9f861e2a71d49571bcf4dd693e358d9af066c7ba9537f8d317ecb562cdd",
      "text": "（呜～在场的大家全都是最棒的！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_i:cmd-000196:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:755bc7439013ac43e5db6f8099b81f60f231dea87d81585e62571d50620afaa5",
      "text": "High×Joker可还远远不止这种程度哦。\n一起嗨到最后吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f0e92f217f01dba89d0ea4719b7028cb261b452bfd173bc21008220bdd6c26",
      "text": "演出结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c2f799b4c09ee7bb058e76ea7e4ec31b282c3bf6c2c53bf113998536b60b7b",
      "text": "New year 315live，真的Mega好玩～！\n庆功宴兼新年会也要超级嗨起来哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71f8d197d22f8126cc088578dc67eebf893c64716a0277e913755dd91af94a1d",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n场地就在这附近对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b78371aa90a879a8ec4534e6bdc5dae32c302fc2485ed06e50f77ab37aa29dc5",
      "text": "是的，顺着这条路走一会儿就到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b9275880ccc3f0a25fc98629d369741a5be3efd3aaa0fa3341efe3e741ecfdc",
      "text": "（咦？在那边施工的难道是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db119d97683950d01a33a0251efca6462718b96259f315c03082063ced79addb",
      "text": "哟，若里！今天人挺多的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fa2f46906f634cd565d7b66135f73efb8ef9157427237d88786e3283be35abc",
      "text": "大叔！还有大家也在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0812b342fa93e973472a2c835576c951e5fca4fc953acb6d934f16c89f7948",
      "text": "前几天我在视频里看到若里当偶像的样子了。\n打鼓的姿态，帅呆了～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1393ba010b6654cd00a84cad36666fd0a89ca55c8857f8fb213dd7a9c7cfb83",
      "text": "哎，不仅是若里。High×Joker全员\n都在闪闪发光，超级帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c86245d3c1eecdb26785c7c3be284f33b7b10710663c6bc3814c8825955eb435",
      "text": "真的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3267a5d650742284feb79b7eb3ac6c5d095fbd9af16dbf7497dc70fd309c0e93",
      "text": "呜～超级开心。\n真的Mega感谢啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc940c8784c068739f8601a5920d4c75772901acab94216280825ba4702520b8",
      "text": "感谢各位能关注High×Joker！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4aab7634874e0380c8bcba728072116c3772263b44454270e538d955c3f3cd9",
      "text": "啊，这位是我们的制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_j:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da84ed69b5bc0e18dcd9d1d3d7cc9c3af7a8390b3038d2bbd40357f128cf5300",
      "text": "这边的大叔们，\n是我打工时关系很好的人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a747d11afa98ef5f3de64fc9b79182bcb51ac031fbb1ba15f3935c4e6371fda",
      "text": "虽然有若里在帮了大忙，\n但看他天天打工我们也很担心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef313938671832d2581d3b5094cf9042c4fd6cafa8059cce63b30b1a3513a59",
      "text": "不过有这么好的朋友在，就让人放心啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae1f8cbcf00ee798aa77f35b3cdcd32761cdefa376a67321bc254b0836c24a89",
      "text": "哪里哪里，有春名亲在身边，\n感到安心的可是我们呀！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2047d123a7b2e479e38fa72bf8a7f8e8ab6627d7f3e20ee07b29803f428ddb8f",
      "text": "遇到困难的时候，他都会听我们倾诉，\n还会给我们提建议呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a67247caa6329d2208cbcf06015c1c54d1386bb38a8274cddd07311c34fab825",
      "text": "而且春名总是很照顾大家……\n非常、温柔……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:871c3090dd87741162f9d16f9de60cf4adac310f1b4cabb6c4cd6b1e50e08f41",
      "text": "我也曾受过春名先生的帮助。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17539a2411e8eabb88ce60c0fefee6e03351079760dde64d52897120901f267e",
      "text": "只要有春名先生在，就有一种他绝对能办到的安心感呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18542a7a5c64b1e9fea12d88e2778e6a2d8cb3b90c9e8fab6c5abb46f1325ea2",
      "text": "各位……谢谢你们。\n我也一直很依赖大家哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:456bcc3e597c62bd7b90f47f0b8b06c0e017a1bd99799efe77b41ce319231e4f",
      "text": "（虽然当时只是为了避免留级，\n但那天去了活动室真的太好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88b0ab06ff6e24cc00370f02c2e6230b4922c2a0e711032c0af34fff973f00ef",
      "text": "（不仅遇到了High×Joker的大家，\n还遇到了●●●●プロデューサー）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13aa8ae18d93c8679323784e06442fbddde5faa5d7ad04dd946a8853353c5b2a",
      "text": "（而且，曾经满脑子只有打工的我，\n做梦也没想到的日子，如今就在眼前）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ce202a4e8d325d2f4066d20a8bdb4f97cf96181bbfed5e66c5e9124a98b7fee",
      "text": "话说，大叔。\n下次一定要来看我们的Live啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10016_01:1_3_10016_01_k:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c411d6eeef412673451c83610b986d3a0638f9fdb81acc2078e8a46502d2cf7",
      "text": "大家可都是最棒的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
